<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 John</book>
  <para style="h">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 John</para>
  <para style="mt">3 John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khangham pa in thuman thutah sunga om ka lawm it Gaius tungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lawm it aw, na hlagau a cidam bang ma-in na zosie ah na lawcin thei nading le na cidam thei nading thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lawmte pawlkhat ang tungin thuman thutah sungah na muonhuoina le thuman thutah sungah na kalsuon dan ang gen ciengun ka na kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tate thuman thutah ah a kalsuon ka zaha ka kipahna za sangin a lienzaw kipahna ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka it lawm aw, amate gelta hi napi lawmte tunga na bawl bangin amate tungah muonhuoi tahin na bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amate in hlattuom pawlpite mai-ah note’ itna thu teci a pang uhi. Pasien tungah gamtat dinga a kilawm za-in a lampi vuah amate na hla lacin sil hoi bawl na hi ta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile amate pen Khris’ min hang tawh khuolzin kipan ahi bo vua, thu um lo mite tung panin bangma panpina a nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thuman thutah tawh nasem tonte i suo thei nadingin tua bang mite i hu ding vua kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpi tungah lai pawlkhat ka hlah zo a, ahi vangin lamkai suoh nuom pa ahi Diotrephes in ka thu ei mang nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n kang haw khah leh kote tungah aman lo-a ei mawsahna le ei gensietna teng kang phawhsah ding hi. Mi gensietna tawh lungkim nai vaset loin, lawmte zong zin tungsah nuom lo a, a tungsah nuomte nangawn khamin hlattuom pawlpi panin a hawlkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kang it lawm aw, thusiete ette loin, thu hoite ette zaw in. A hoi-a gamta poma Pasien pan ahi hi; a sie-a gamta poma Pasien a mu nai lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zosie in Demetrius a phat vua, tua thuman thutah mama in zong teci a pang hi. Kote in zong ama ka phat vua, ka teci panna uh a man lam na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kungah giel ding tampi ka nei a, ahi vangin laitui le laikung tawh giel ka sawm sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nang tawh kimu bai ding ka lamen a, kimaitang tuo-in i kiho ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang tungah nopna hing tung taheh. Lawmte in zong ang noset uhi. Khum sunga om lawmte a milipin khatciet ei na noset pieh in.
  </para>
</usx>
